---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The app · Mental Note" active="the-app">
<div class="app phead-dark"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">The app</div>
  <h2>Five minutes. Three questions.</h2>
  <div class="agrid" style="margin-top:36px">
    <div>
      <p class="lead">A check-in that fits between classes. The questions change with each month's theme, so it never becomes the same three prompts forever.</p>
      <p class="promise">Saved on your phone and nowhere else. We can't read them, there are no accounts, and there's nothing to sell. No streaks either — a bad week isn't a broken one.</p>
      <div class="install paper tape dk">
        <b>Add it to your home screen</b>
        <p>On iPhone: tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. On Android, your browser will offer to install it.</p>
        <a class="go" href="#">Open the check-in →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="screen paper tape dk">
      <div class="hd"><span>Wed 8 Oct</span><span>Check-in</span></div>
      <div class="qn">Question two</div>
      <div class="qt">What would make tomorrow a little easier?</div>
      <div class="ans">Type your answer…</div>
      <div class="nav2"><span class="dots"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i></i></span><span>Next →</span></div>
      <div class="help"><b>Need someone now</b>Call or text 988 · Text HOME to 741741</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<div class="light"><div class="block"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="eyebrow">What it does and doesn't do</div>
  <h2>Deliberately small.</h2>
  <dl class="qa">
    <div><dt>No accounts</dt><dd>Nothing to sign up for. Open it and start.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>No streaks</dt><dd>Streak counters punish the people having the worst weeks. There aren't any.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Works offline</dt><dd>Once it's on your home screen it opens without signal.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Export any time</dt><dd>One button pulls everything you've written into a file you keep.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Stored on your device</dt><dd>Which also means clearing your browser data erases it. Export if it matters.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Help is one tap away</dt><dd>988 and Crisis Text Line are on every screen, always.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
